    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39410" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθαρσ-έω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθαρσ-ρρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put trust in</i> or <i>on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν ἀρωγαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Brut.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.270
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>take
				heart to resist</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἐχθροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					3.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				4.34
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				9.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῷ πελάγει</span>
			<i>venture on . . </i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.56
			</span></i>: abs., <i>take courage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				41.50
			</span></i>,al.</div>
